{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"suzyDialogue":[{"->":".^.FirstIntroduction"},{"FirstIntroduction":["^Oh hey, this is rare. Looks like I got a visitor today! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^I'm Suzy. I'm in charge of everything graphical you see on screen: Sprites, colours, collisions, movement... ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^To handle them I have to move fast. 16MHz fast, actually! That's four times faster than Mikey, which comes in handy when you're pushing pixels like I do! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.Questions"},{"#f":1}],"ReturningIntroduction":[["^Hey welcome back! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.5.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^> Could you explain your role here again? ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^> Mind if I have another go at 'Collision Control'? ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.5.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Sure! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.Questions"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Love your enthusiasm! Need a quick refresher? ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.c-1.12.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^> Yes. ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.c-1.12.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^> Nope, I'm ready! ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.c-1.12.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"suzyDialogue.CollisionControlInstructions"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.ReturningIntroduction.0.c-1.12.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","ev",{"x()":"StartCollisionControl"},"pop","/ev","\n","done",{"->":"suzyDialogue.Questions"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Questions":[[["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^> How do you draw sprites? ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^> How does collision detection work? ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":2},{"s":["^> Do you have any unique tricks for processing graphics? ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.3.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-3","flg":2},{"s":["^> Any chance I could see you in action? ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Okay, picture this: You want a spaceship zooming across the screen. You don't just throw me an image and say \"go\". I need two things: ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^1. Pixel data - the raw visual. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^2. A Sprite Control Block - basically a set of instructions telling me how to handle it. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^Give me those, and I'll blit that thing onto the screen buffer in no time. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Ah, my secret sauce! I have a technique that no other consoles at my time have figured out. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^While I'm drawing, I also keep an eye out for overlaps. Each sprite gets a collision number - sort of like a nametag, numbered 0 to 15. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^If two sprites overlap, I record the highest number into something called the collision depository. You (or your game code) can check it afterward to see what hit what. And yes - this is pixel-perfect. None of that rectangle-guessing nonsense other consoles are used to. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Absolutely! I'm actually really well known for reusing graphics to be more efficient, I'm super proud of it. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^One piece of pixel data - let's say a robot - can be reused in multiple SCBs. I can draw it in different spots, scales, or colours without duplicating the actual image data. Saves memory and still looks great, Win-win! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.Questions.0.c-3.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.3.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I can do you one better! I'll let you try your hand at 'Collision Control'! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.CollisionControlInstructions"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"CollisionControlInstructions":[["^Just press the Spacebar whenever you see two objects collide on-screen.","\n","^Sounds simple but its quite tough! You sure you're ready?","\n",["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.CollisionControlInstructions.0.4.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^> Sure am! ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.CollisionControlInstructions.0.5.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^> I need more time... ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.CollisionControlInstructions.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.4.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^I love your confidence, Let's get started! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","ev",{"x()":"StartCollisionControl"},"pop","/ev","\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.CollisionControlInstructions.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.5.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Oh, thats okay. Come back soon! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^In the meantime, make sure you meet Mikey if you haven't already. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","ev",{"x()":"ExitDialogue"},"pop","/ev","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"PostMinigame":["ev",{"VAR?":"collisionControl_Victory"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Wow, you did great! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^That task can get really hectic at times but you held your own pretty well. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^Here, take this 'Collision Control' badge as a token of my appreciation! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","^[YOU TAKE THE BADGE] ","#","^speaker: Player","/#","\n","^Thanks for all your help! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","ev",{"x()":"ExitDialogue"},"pop","/ev","\n","done",{"->":".^.^.^.5"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Tough isn't it? Would you like to try again? ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.PostMinigame.4.b.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":2},{"s":["^> Yes. ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.PostMinigame.4.b.7.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":2},{"s":["^> No. ","#","^speaker: Player","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"->":".^.^.^.5"},{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.PostMinigame.4.b.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Good luck! ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","ev",{"x()":"StartCollisionControl"},"pop","/ev","\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"suzyDialogue.PostMinigame.4.b.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.7.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Feel free to come back and try again whenever you'd like. ","#","^speaker: Suzy","/#","\n","ev",{"x()":"ExitDialogue"},"pop","/ev","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"collisionControl_Victory"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}